@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "What is Azure DevOps";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <h1 class="text-center text-primary">What is Azure DevOps?</h1>
    <p class="text-center lead">Azure DevOps is a suite of services that enables developers to plan, develop, test, and deliver software efficiently using DevOps best practices.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction to Azure DevOps -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">Overview of Azure DevOps</h2>
        <p>
            Azure DevOps provides a comprehensive set of development tools to support the entire software development lifecycle. It offers solutions for version control, build automation, release management, and agile project management.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-overview.jpg" alt="Azure DevOps Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure DevOps streamlines software development processes.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Key Features of Azure DevOps -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Key Features</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure Repos:</strong> Version control system supporting Git and TFVC.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure Pipelines:</strong> CI/CD automation for building, testing, and deploying applications.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure Boards:</strong> Agile project management tools with dashboards, backlog tracking, and Kanban boards.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure Artifacts:</strong> Package management for hosting and sharing Maven, npm, and NuGet packages.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure Test Plans:</strong> Comprehensive testing solutions for automated and manual testing.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-features.jpg" alt="Azure DevOps Features" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure DevOps offers integrated tools to enhance software development.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits of Azure DevOps -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Benefits of Using Azure DevOps</h2>
        <p>Organizations leverage Azure DevOps for its scalability, automation, and seamless integration with other Microsoft services.</p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>End-to-End DevOps:</strong> All-in-one solution covering planning, development, testing, and deployment.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Cloud and On-Premises Support:</strong> Works with cloud, on-premises, and hybrid environments.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Enhanced Collaboration:</strong> Enables seamless collaboration between development and operations teams.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Security and Compliance:</strong> Built-in compliance and security features to protect code and data.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scalability:</strong> Easily scale projects from small teams to enterprise-level development.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-benefits.jpg" alt="Azure DevOps Benefits" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure DevOps helps organizations deliver high-quality software efficiently.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Azure DevOps is a powerful platform that simplifies software development and deployment processes, enabling teams to adopt DevOps practices effectively. Whether you are a small development team or an enterprise, Azure DevOps provides the tools necessary for efficient and high-quality software delivery.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-conclusion.jpg" alt="Future of Azure DevOps" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure DevOps continues to evolve, driving innovation in software development.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
